	<section>
		<h2>Spring JdbcTemplate</h2>
		<p>
			<code>query</code>, <code>queryForObject</code>, <code>queryForList</code>
			, <code>update</code>, <code>batchUpdate</code>, and the rest of the
			family. The single-line string at the end stays as written:
		</p>
		<Recipe name="java-spring" lang="java" />
		<p>
			Named parameters (<code>:customerId</code>, as{" "}
			<code>NamedParameterJdbcTemplate</code> and JPA use them) need{" "}
			<code>colon-params</code> as well. JPA&rsquo;s numbered <code>?1</code> is
			covered by <code>question-params</code>.
		</p>
	</section>
